    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH1a0903-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.1-h" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:01:26.067+09:00">Des fondements de la Voie</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:02:19.217+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:02:21.992+09:00">1. Une tradition rapporte :</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:02:26.587+09:00">« Le Ciel donne vie à tous lesêtres, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:03:56.202+09:00">la Terre les nourrit </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:04:00.245+09:00">et le Saint les accomplit 1. » </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:04:58.08+09:00">C’estseulement quand vertu et mérite [du Saint Souverain] formentune triade avec le Ciel et la Terre et s’y conjoignent</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:05:19.462+09:00">queprennent naissance la Voie et ses arts.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:06:32.041+09:00">2. Voilà pourquoi il est dit :</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:06:58.561+09:00">Il 3 dispose le soleil et la lune,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:07:05.937+09:00">Distribue les étoiles et les constellations,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:07:13.834+09:00">Déroule les saisons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:07:23.244+09:00">Harmonise le yin et le yang,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:07:41.589+09:00">Répand les souffles et gouverne la nature [des choses],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:07:53.88+09:00">Range dans une suite continue les cinq phases,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:08:01.032+09:00">Engendrant au printemps, mûrissant en été,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:08:07.276+09:00">Récoltant en automne, engrangeant en hiver.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:08:13.113+09:00">Le yang produit tonnerre et éclairs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:08:22.766+09:00">Le yin fait advenir neige et givre ;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:08:33.941+09:00">Il nourrit et élève tous les êtres vivants</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:08:48.273+09:00">Dans une alternance de profusion et de disparition,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:09:02.307+09:00">Les attendrit par le vent et la pluie,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:09:12.336+09:00">Les assèche par la lumière du soleil,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:09:19.148+09:00">Les réchauffe par les souffles nodaux,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:09:26.483+09:00">Les refroidit 4 par la tombée du givre,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:09:34.897+09:00">Les positionne relativement aux myriades d’étoiles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:09:45.64+09:00">Les coordonne grâce au Boisseau 5,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:09:46.84+09:00">Les enveloppe entre les six pôles de l’espace 6,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:11:50.203+09:00">Les tisse dans le réseau de sa discipline,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:12:02.515+09:00">Les réforme par des catastrophes et d’[extraordinaires]changements 7,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:12:53.286+09:00">Les avertit par d’heureux présages 8,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:12:58.276+09:00">Les meut par la vie et la mort</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:13:48.114+09:00">Et les éveille par les signes célestes 9.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:14:03.375+09:00">3. Aussi ce qui relève du Ciel peut être observé,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:14:38.169+09:00">ce quidépend de la Terre peut être mesuré, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:15:01.813+09:00">[la nature] des êtres peutêtre disciplinée </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:15:03.442+09:00">et celle des hommes diagnostiquée.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:16:48.721+09:00">4. Voilà pourquoi il distribue 10 sur la terre les Cinq pics 11,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:16:56.965+09:00">trace les lignes des Quatre fleuves 12, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:17:14.734+09:00">les cercles des étangs etdes marais,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:17:22.807+09:00">les veines des rivières et des sources,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:17:35.089+09:00">les hérissed’êtres qu’il nourrit en fonction de leur espèce, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:17:47.585+09:00">les couvre deplantes dont les racines se démultiplient, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:17:53.421+09:00">manifeste les corps etnourrit leur quintessence, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:17:59.258+09:00">et ainsi donne à tous les êtres vivantsleur position. </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:18:07.674+09:00">[Il] ne s’oppose pas au rythme des saisons, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:20:24.155+09:00">neviole pas la nature des êtres, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:20:32.265+09:00">ne se dissimule, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-2a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:20:33.052+09:00">ni ne feint 13.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-3a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:23:33.768+09:00">6. C’est alors que les sages de l’Antiquité 15 contemplèrenten haut les signes célestes </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-3a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:27:56.659+09:00">et examinèrent en bas les lignesde la terre,  </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-3a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:28:10.203+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-4a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:29:33.236+09:00">6. C’est alors que les sages de l’Antiquité 15 contemplèrenten haut les signes célestes</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-4a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:29:42.555+09:00">et examinèrent en bas les lignesde la terre, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-4a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:29:57.623+09:00">tracèrent et dessinèrent les [trigrammes] Qianl’Initiateur et Kun le Réceptif 16 </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-4a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:30:08.666+09:00">pour déterminer la Voie del’homme ;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-4a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:30:19.793+09:00">le peuple commença dès lors à s’éveiller [à l’ordredes choses], </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-4a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:30:26.993+09:00">reconnut l’existence de l’affection entre le pèreet le fils, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-4a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:30:35.12+09:00">de l’équité entre le prince et le sujet, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-4a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:30:43.495+09:00">de la différenceentre l’époux et l’épouse </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-4a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:30:50.089+09:00">et de l’ordre entre les aînés et lesplus jeunes. </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-4a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:31:04.781+09:00">Furent alors nommés les mille fonctionnaires </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-4a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:31:05.182+09:00">etla Voie royale naquit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-5a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:32:01.734+09:00">7. Le peuple mangeait encore de la viande crue, buvait dusang frais</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-5a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:32:07.964+09:00">et se vêtait de peaux et de fourrures. </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-5a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:32:14.984+09:00">Vint le DivinLaboureur 17 </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-5a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:32:38.913+09:00">qui considéra que les bêtes qui rampent, volentou courent </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-5a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:32:46.466+09:00">pouvaient difficilement suffire aux besoins dupeuple ;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-5a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:33:10.858+09:00">il chercha d’autres aliments comestibles, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-5a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:33:18.112+09:00">goûta lesfruits des diverses plantes, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-5a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:33:25.495+09:00">testa les saveurs aigres et amères</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-5a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:33:26.656+09:00">et lui enseigna [comment] manger les cinq céréales 18.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:34:58.136+09:00">8. Le peuple sous le ciel </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:35:15.963+09:00">habitait dans les plaines et logeaitdans les cavernes </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T01:35:35.531+09:00">mais n’avait toujours pas de demeures ni depièces, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T03:51:34.489+09:00">de sorte qu’il partageait le même environnement queles oiseaux et les bêtes sauvages.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T03:51:47.783+09:00">Vint le Souverain Jaune 19 quiabattit les arbres, assembla les pièces de bois,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T03:52:00.508+09:00">construisit despalais et des demeures, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T03:52:18.006+09:00">éleva la poutre faîtière sur laquelle il fitdescendre l’avant-toit </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T03:52:18.354+09:00">pour protéger du vent et de la pluie.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T03:56:48.539+09:00">9. Le peuple savait désormais vivre dans des maisons etmanger les céréales</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T03:56:57.341+09:00">mais ignorait encore comment travailler.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:11:41.576+09:00">Vint le Souverain Millet 20 qui traça les frontières </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:11:56.657+09:00">et délimitales champs </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:12:01.144+09:00">afin de distinguer ce qui convenait à chaque typede terrain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:12:42.816+09:00">Il défricha et ensemença les terres </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:12:47.572+09:00">pour nourrir le peuple, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:13:16.223+09:00">planta les mûriers et le chanvre, produisant de la soie et de la jute </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-6a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:13:32.274+09:00">pour couvrir les corps.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-7a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:15:06.857+09:00">10. À cette époque,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-7a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:15:28.006+09:00">les Quatre fleuves 21 ne s’écoulaient pasencore </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-7a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:15:35.462+09:00">et les inondations sévissaient. </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-7a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:16:25.534+09:00">Yu le Grand libéra le fleuveBleu, ouvrit un passage au fleuve Jaune,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-7a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:17:19.397+09:00">fit circuler les eaux versles Quatre fleuves </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-7a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:17:25.441+09:00">et les mena à la mer.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-7a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:17:31.922+09:00">Les plus petites [rivières]se jetaient dans les plus grandes ;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-7a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:17:37.832+09:00">les plus basses recevaient lesplus hautes ;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-7a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:18:07.184+09:00">toutes s’écoulaient naturellement </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-7a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:18:11.571+09:00">et trouvaient leurlit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-7a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:18:29.032+09:00">C’est alors seulement que le peuple put quitter les endroitsélevés et dangereux</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-7a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:18:30.213+09:00">pour habiter les plaines.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-8a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:22:20.255+09:00">11. Les fleuves et les ravins s’entremêlaient,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-8a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:22:28.981+09:00">empêchant lacirculation de l’influence civilisatrice des Saints Souverains ;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-8a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:22:40.223+09:00">lesneuf régions étaient coupées les unes des autres</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-8a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:22:54.068+09:00">et n’existaientpas encore bateaux et chars </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-8a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:23:04.183+09:00">qui servent à traverser les eauxprofondes et parcourir des distances éloignées.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-8a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:23:20.057+09:00">Vint alorsXizhong 22 qui courba le bois pour en faire des roues</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-8a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:23:26.833+09:00">et enutilisa les parties droites pour les timons, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-8a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:23:33.422+09:00">attela les chevauxet soumit les boeufs au joug, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-8a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:23:40.799+09:00">fit flotter les barques en s’aidantdes rames, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-8a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:23:42.398+09:00">pour suppléer à la force humaine.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-9a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:28:12.11+09:00">12. Le métal fut fondu, le bois gravé, les coloquintesdécoupées et l’argile cuite pour préparer outils et ustensiles.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-9a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:28:23.984+09:00">Alors le peuple sut la valeur relative des choses, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-9a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:28:33.39+09:00">apprécierl’utile et détester les difficultés,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-9a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:28:37.832+09:00">éviter le dur labeur et préférerles tâches aisées. </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-9a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:29:16.628+09:00">Vint alors Gaoyao 23 qui créa les prisons etinstitua le contrôle des crimes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-9a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:29:22.762+09:00">distribua les récompenses et leschâtiments, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-9a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:29:26.754+09:00">distingua le juste et l’injuste, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-9a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:29:34.751+09:00">sépara clairement lesactes méritants des mauvais, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-9a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:29:46.494+09:00">surveilla les félons et les pervers</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-9a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-19T04:29:47.315+09:00">et élimina les oisifs et les fauteurs de troubles.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
